## 2. Missing Features — Prioritized Roadmap

### 🔴 P0 — Critical (Must-Have for Production)

---

#### 2.1 Forgot Password / Password Reset

**Why:** Users who forget their password are permanently locked out. This is a basic auth requirement.

**Design:**

```
Flow: Login Page → "Forgot Password?" → Enter Email → OTP sent → Verify OTP → Set New Password
```

**Backend:**
| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `models/OTP.js` | Schema: `{ email, otp, expiresAt }` with TTL index (5 min) |
| [controllers/authController.js](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/backend/controllers/authController.js) | Add: `forgotPassword()`, `verifyOTP()`, `resetPassword()` |
| `utils/emailService.js` | Nodemailer config (Gmail SMTP or Resend API) |

```
Schema: OTP
─────────────────────────────
email       String (indexed)
otp         String (6-digit)
expiresAt   Date (TTL: 5 min)
createdAt   Date
```

**API Endpoints:**
```
POST /api/auth/forgot-password    { email }          → sends OTP to email
POST /api/auth/verify-otp         { email, otp }     → returns temp token
POST /api/auth/reset-password     { token, password } → updates password
```

**Frontend:**
| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `pages/ForgotPasswordPage.tsx` | 3-step form: Email → OTP → New Password |
| [services/api.ts](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/frontend/src/services/api.ts) | Add `authApi.forgotPassword()`, `authApi.verifyOTP()`, `authApi.resetPassword()` |

**Dependencies:** `npm install nodemailer` (backend)

---

#### 2.2 Email Verification on Registration

**Why:** Prevents fake accounts, ensures contact validity.

**Design:**
```
Flow: Register → Account created (unverified) → Email with OTP → Verify → Account activated
```

**Backend:**
| Change | Description |
|---|---|
| [models/User.js](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/backend/models/User.js) | Add field: `isEmailVerified: { type: Boolean, default: false }` |
| [controllers/authController.js](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/backend/controllers/authController.js) | Send OTP on register, add `verifyEmail()` handler |
| [middleware/authMiddleware.js](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/backend/middleware/authMiddleware.js) | Optionally block unverified users from protected routes |

**Frontend:**
| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `pages/VerifyEmailPage.tsx` | OTP input form shown after registration |
| Redirect from [LoginPage.tsx](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/frontend/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx) | If `isEmailVerified === false`, redirect to verify page |

---

#### 2.3 Input Validation & Error Handling (Global)

**Why:** Many endpoints lack server-side validation. `express-validator` is installed but underused.

**Design:**
| Area | Fix |
|---|---|
| All auth routes | Validate email format, password strength (min 8 chars, mixed case) |
| Advisory routes | Validate crop/stage against allowed enums |
| File uploads | Validate MIME type + file size server-side (not just multer) |
| Frontend forms | Add `zod` schemas for all forms (already installed) |

---

### 🟡 P1 — High Priority (Complete Before Launch)

---

#### 2.4 Notification System (In-App + Push)

**Why:** Farmers need alerts for weather warnings, price changes, new advisories, scheme deadlines.

**Design:**

```
Schema: Notification
─────────────────────────────
userId      ObjectId (ref: User)
type        Enum: 'weather_alert' | 'price_alert' | 'advisory' | 'scheme' | 'admin_broadcast'
title       String
message     String
isRead      Boolean (default: false)
link        String (optional deep link)
createdAt   Date
```

**Backend:**
| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `models/Notification.js` | Schema as above |
| `controllers/notificationController.js` | `getNotifications()`, `markRead()`, `markAllRead()` |
| `routes/notificationRoutes.js` | `GET /api/notifications`, `PATCH /api/notifications/:id/read` |
| Background jobs | Auto-create notifications on price spikes, weather alerts |
| Socket.io | Emit `new_notification` event to farmer's room in real-time |

**Frontend:**
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| `components/NotificationBell.tsx` | Bell icon in Navbar with unread badge count |
| `components/NotificationPanel.tsx` | Slide-out panel listing recent notifications |
| Sound | Optional notification sound on new alert |

---

#### 2.5 Export Data (PDF / CSV)

**Why:** Farmers and admins need to save, print, and share reports.

**Design:**

| Export From | Format | Library |
|---|---|---|
| Market Prices table | CSV | `json2csv` (backend) or client-side `Blob` |
| Advisory report | PDF | `jspdf` + `html2canvas` (frontend) |
| Admin user report | CSV | Backend endpoint `GET /api/admin/users/export` |
| Farm expense log (future) | CSV/PDF | Both |

**Frontend:**
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| `components/ExportButton.tsx` | Reusable button with dropdown: PDF / CSV |
| Integration | Add to MarketPage, AdminUsers, Advisory results |

---

#### 2.6 Price Alerts (Target Price Notifications)

**Why:** Farmers want to sell when price reaches their target.

**Design:**

```
Schema: PriceAlert
─────────────────────────────
userId       ObjectId (ref: User)
crop         String
targetPrice  Number
direction    Enum: 'above' | 'below'
isActive     Boolean (default: true)
triggered    Boolean (default: false)
triggeredAt  Date
createdAt    Date
```

**Backend:**
| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `models/PriceAlert.js` | Schema as above |
| `controllers/priceAlertController.js` | CRUD: create, list, delete alerts |
| `jobs/priceAlertJob.js` | Runs after market price refresh → checks all active alerts → triggers notifications |

**Frontend:**
| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| `components/SetPriceAlert.tsx` | Modal: select crop, enter target price, choose above/below |
| Integration in [MarketPage.tsx](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/frontend/src/pages/MarketPage.tsx) | "Set Alert" button next to each crop price |

---

#### 2.7 Farm Profile / Multi-Farm Support

**Why:** Many farmers manage multiple fields with different crops, soils, and sizes.

**Design:**

```
Schema: Farm
─────────────────────────────
userId        ObjectId (ref: User)
name          String ("Plot A", "River Field")
location      String
area          Number (acres)
soilType      String
crops         [String]
irrigationType String
isDefault     Boolean
createdAt     Date
```

**Backend:**
- `models/Farm.js` — schema as above
- `controllers/farmController.js` — CRUD operations
- All advisory/irrigation/weather APIs accept optional `farmId` parameter

**Frontend:**
- `pages/FarmsPage.tsx` — list/add/edit farms
- Dashboard farm selector dropdown — switch between farms

---

### 🟠 P2 — Medium Priority (Post-Launch Enhancements)

---

#### 2.8 Dark Mode Toggle

**Design:** Already have `next-themes` installed. Just need:
- Add `<ThemeProvider>` wrapper in [App.tsx](file:///c:/c/Web%20Project/KrishiSmart/frontend/src/App.tsx)
- Add Sun/Moon toggle in Navbar next to LanguageToggle
- Tailwind `dark:` classes already work with Shadcn UI

---

#### 2.9 Crop Calendar / Planner

**Design:**
- Visual monthly calendar showing sowing → vegetative → flowering → harvest timeline
- Auto-populated from sowing calendar API data
- User can add custom events (spray schedule, market day)
- Component: `pages/CropCalendarPage.tsx` using a calendar library like `react-big-calendar`

---

#### 2.10 Expense & Income Tracker (Farm Ledger)

**Design:**

```
Schema: Transaction
─────────────────────────────
userId      ObjectId
farmId      ObjectId (optional)
type        Enum: 'expense' | 'income'
category    Enum: 'seeds' | 'fertilizer' | 'labour' | 'pesticide' | 'equipment' | 'harvest_sale' | 'other'
amount      Number
description String
date        Date
crop        String (optional)
createdAt   Date
```

**Frontend:**
- `pages/FarmLedgerPage.tsx` — table + chart view
- Monthly/seasonal summary with pie chart (expenses) and bar chart (income vs expenses)
- Export to CSV

---

#### 2.11 Community Forum

**Design:**

```
Schema: ForumPost
─────────────────────────────
authorId    ObjectId (ref: User)
title       String
body        String
category    Enum: 'question' | 'tip' | 'showcase' | 'market_info'
crop        String (optional)
likes       [ObjectId]
replies     [{ authorId, body, createdAt }]
createdAt   Date
```

**Frontend:**
- `pages/CommunityPage.tsx` — feed of posts with filters
- Post detail with replies
- "Ask KrishiBot" button next to each question for AI answer

---

#### 2.12 Soil Health Tracker

**Design:**
- Log soil test results: N, P, K, pH, organic carbon, EC
- Compare across seasons
- Auto-recommendation: "Your soil needs more Potassium based on last test"
- Integrates with existing `SoilCondition` model

---

### 🟢 P3 — Low Priority (Future Vision)

---

#### 2.13 Progressive Web App (PWA) / Offline Mode

**Design:**
- Add `manifest.json` + service worker via `vite-plugin-pwa`
- Cache critical pages (dashboard, advisory) for offline viewing
- Queue API requests when offline, sync when back online
- **Big impact** for rural areas with spotty internet

---

#### 2.14 Satellite Crop Monitoring (NDVI)

**Design:**
- Integrate NASA/Sentinel-2 satellite NDVI data
- Show field health map (green = healthy, red = stressed)
- Requires farm GPS coordinates (from Farm Profile feature)
- API: Sentinel Hub or Google Earth Engine

---

#### 2.15 Predictive Market Pricing (ML)

**Design:**
- Train a model on historical Agmarknet data (already collecting)
- Predict next 7/30 day prices per crop per mandi
- Display as forecast chart alongside actual trend
- Could use TensorFlow.js or a Python microservice

---

#### 2.16 IoT Sensor Integration

**Design:**
- MQTT broker for soil moisture, temperature sensors
- Real-time dashboard with sensor readings
- Auto-trigger irrigation alerts when moisture drops below threshold
- Requires hardware (ESP32 + sensors)

---

