## 4. Tech Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| **Backend** | Node.js + Express 5 | REST API |
| **Database** | MongoDB + Mongoose 9 | TTL indexes, aggregation pipelines |
| **Auth** | JWT + bcrypt | 7-day token expiry |
| **AI** | Google Gemini 2.0 Flash | Advisory, Chatbot, Disease ID |
| **Real-time** | Socket.io | Admin broadcasts, notifications |
| **File Upload** | Multer | Profile pics, fertilizer images, disease photos |
| **Background Jobs** | node-cron | Weather, market, soil data refresh |
| **Frontend** | React 18 + TypeScript | Vite bundler |
| **UI Library** | Shadcn UI + Radix | 50+ components |
| **Styling** | TailwindCSS 3 | Dark mode ready |
| **Charts** | Recharts | Market trends, dashboard stats |
| **i18n** | i18next | Hindi + English |
| **State** | React Query + Context | Server state + auth state |
| **Email** | Nodemailer *(to add)* | OTP, password reset |
| **Export** | jsPDF + json2csv *(to add)* | Reports |

---

## 5. Quick Reference — File Architecture

```
KrishiSmart/
├── backend/
│   ├── config/         db.js
│   ├── controllers/    14 controllers (auth, admin, advisory, chatbot, disease, etc.)
│   ├── middleware/      authMiddleware, requestLogger, errorHandler
│   ├── models/          11 models (User, Fertilizer, MarketPrice, AdvisoryCache, etc.)
│   ├── routes/          12 route files
│   ├── jobs/            Cron jobs (weather, market, soil refresh)
│   ├── adapters/        External API adapters
│   ├── services/        Business logic services
│   ├── utils/           advisoryRules, pestRiskEngine, weatherCache, etc.
│   └── server.js        Express + Socket.io entry point
│
├── frontend/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/  layout/ (Navbar, AdminLayout) + ui/ (52 Shadcn components)
│   │   ├── contexts/    AuthContext
│   │   ├── context/     SocketContext
│   │   ├── i18n/        index.ts + locales/ (en.json, hi.json)
│   │   ├── pages/       14 farmer pages + 7 admin pages
│   │   ├── services/    api.ts (centralized API client)
│   │   └── App.tsx      Routing + ProtectedRoute
│   └── index.html
│
└── package.json         Root workspace
```

This document serves as the living roadmap. Features should be implemented in priority order (P0 → P1 → P2 → P3).
